<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The About-page logo. `MiuixAboutPage` uses this drawable as a *mask* for a blurred backdrop
  (`BlendMode.DstIn`), so only the alpha channel shows — the fill colour is irrelevant.

  Geometry is the launcher cat (same five paths as ic_launcher_monochrome.xml) wrapped in a
  <group> translate: the launcher keeps the cat in the bottom-left corner on purpose, which would
  look like a misaligned logo when the About page centres this mark in its 88dp header. The
  translate moves the ink's mass centroid (41.4, 58.8) onto the canvas centre.
-->
